# ============================================
# Students Tracker — Local Lite DB (No External DB)
# 100% In-Browser Database — IndexedDB via Dexie
# Open the site → local DB is created automatically, all data stays on device
# ============================================
# ✅ No Supabase required for local mode. All auth & data are stored in the browser.
#    Just run: npm install && npm run dev  → open http://localhost:5173 → Sign Up → data saved locally
#
# For local dev you DON'T need any env vars. The app creates its DB in the browser automatically:
#   - IndexedDB: bejkhonda-school (via Dexie)
#   - Session: localStorage bejkhonda-session
#   - Users: Dexie table `users` + fallback localStorage
#   - Data: school, classes, students, gradingScale, mtrRecords, snapshots
#
# Optional — only if you want external sync (Supabase / Vercel Blob):
# --------------------------------------------

# --- Supabase (OPTIONAL — only for cloud sync, not needed for local) ---
# Get from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/hzgaflrabmrcsokhoatv/settings/api
# If left empty, app uses 100% local IndexedDB
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# For server-side admin ops (only if you enable Supabase sync)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

# --- Admin Seed (only for Supabase mode; local mode creates admin via /signup) ---
ADMIN_EMAIL=yusufdupsc1@gmail.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=Bejkhonda@2025!Secure
ADMIN_SCHOOL_NAME=বেজখণ্ড সঃ প্রাঃ বিদ্যালয়

# --- Vercel Blob Remote Sync (OPTIONAL — for manual Backup/Restore → Vercel Blob) ---
ADMIN_TOKEN=change-me-to-a-random-secret
VITE_ADMIN_TOKEN=change-me-to-a-random-secret

# --- Vercel Deployment (OPTIONAL — for CI) ---
VERCEL_TOKEN=
VERCEL_ORG_ID=
VERCEL_PROJECT_ID=

# --- Supabase Migrations (OPTIONAL — CI) ---
SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=hzgaflrabmrcsokhoatv
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# --- Notes ---
# - Local mode: no .env needed. Just `npm ci && npm run verify` and open browser — DB auto-creates.
# - Data is per-browser/per-device. To share data, use Settings → Export/Import JSON or Remote Sync (if Blob configured).
# - Request persistent storage: app calls navigator.storage.persist() on first load.
# - To clear local DB: DevTools → Application → IndexedDB → Delete bejkhonda-school, or Settings → Reset.
# - Supabase is now opt-in. If you set VITE_SUPABASE_* the legacy Supabase auth can be re-enabled via VITE_USE_SUPABASE=true (see src/lib/supabase.ts).
